_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\">Bless</a> and cannot stack with it.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_The_Pain_Maiden.27s_Blessing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_The_Pain_Maiden's_Blessing\">Sources of The Pain Maiden's Blessing</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pain_Maiden%27s_Blessing\" title=\"The Pain Maiden's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Pain Maiden's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pain_Maiden%27s_Blessing\" title=\"The Pain Maiden's Blessing\">The Pain Maiden's Blessing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=